    <div class="feed-wrapper">
        <h2 class="feed-title">MCP Security Best Practices: Check Your Own Server First</h2>
            <div class="feed-excerpt">19 August 2026. Checked against MCP specification 2026-07-28.

Most MCP security best practice do not go far enough.</div>
        <div class="feed-right">
            <time class="feed-date" datetime="2026-08-18">
                18 Aug 2026
            </time>
